0001>\ndefines a functor of <MATH_0012>-categories\n<MATHSEG_0005>Algebraic-Stacks<MATHSEG_0006>Algebraic-Stacks<MATHSEG_0007>\nwhich defines equivalences of morphism categories\n<MATHSEG_0008>Algebraic-Stacks<MATHSEG_0009>Algebraic-Stacks<MATHSEG_0010>\nfor every objects <MATH_0013> of\n<MATHSEG_0011>Algebraic-Stacks<MATHSEG_0012>. An object\n<MATH_0014> of <MATHSEG_0013>Algebraic-Stacks<MATHSEG_0014>\nis equivalence to <MATH_0015> for some\n<MATH_0016> in <MATHSEG_0015>Algebraic-Stacks<MATHSEG_0016>\nif and only if it has a presentation <MATH_0017>\nwith <MATH_0018> isomorphic to <MATH_0019>, <MATH_0020> for some\n<MATH_0021>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3fe6f4a51f5d11fff833679fbdc1ea796efe95d8085505a73a39c99a65df6aa8", "unit_id": "tag:04X3:statement"}
